        "original_id": "7becb366-1ce9-54aa-921d-2fd173efed36",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Bacon, Curtis Hanson, Meryl Streep, David Strathairn, John C. Reilly, Benjamin Bratt, Joseph Mazzello, Lawrence Turman, Sosie Bacon, Kyra Sedgwick\n- Products: The River Wild, Footloose, JFK, A Few Good Men, Apollo 13, Mystic River, Pretty Poison, The Great White Hope, The Thing, Mass Appeal, Short Circuit, American History X\n- Roles: actor, musician, actress, director, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Lawrence Turman produced the film Pretty Poison in 1968.\n- Lawrence Turman produced the film The Great White Hope in 1970.\n- Lawrence Turman produced the film The Thing in 1982.\n- Kevin Bacon appeared in the film Footloose in 1984.\n- Lawrence Turman produced the film Mass Appeal in 1984.\n- Lawrence Turman produced the film Short Circuit in 1986.\n- Kevin Bacon appeared in the film JFK in 1991.\n- Sosie Bacon was born on March 15, 1992.\n- Kevin Bacon appeared in the film A Few Good Men in 1992.\n- The River Wild is a 1994 American adventure crime-thriller film directed by Curtis Hanson.\n- The River Wild stars Meryl Streep, Kevin Bacon, David Strathairn, John C. Reilly, Benjamin Bratt, and Joseph Mazzello as Roarke.\n- Lawrence Turman produced The River Wild in 1994.\n- Kevin Bacon appeared in the film Apollo 13 in 1995.\n- Lawrence Turman produced the film American History X in 1998.\n- Kevin Bacon appeared in the film Mystic River in 2003.\n- Kevin Bacon was born on July 8, 1958, and he is an American actor and musician.\n- Sosie Bacon is an American actress and the daughter of Kevin Bacon and Kyra Sedgwick.",
